cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use priya_loader in your research, please cite it."
title: "priya_loader: ML-friendly access to the PRIYA Lyman-alpha simulation suite"
abstract: >-
  A clean loader that turns the PRIYA MP-Gadget Lyman-alpha hydrodynamic
  simulation suite into ML-ready 3D numpy arrays: the initial-condition density
  field and the Lyman-alpha optical-depth (tau) field per simulation and redshift,
  with the simulation parameters.
authors:
  - family-names: Ho
    given-names: Ming-Feng
    email: mfho@umich.edu
version: 0.1.0.dev0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jibanCat/priya_loader"
keywords:
  - lyman-alpha
  - cosmology
  - simulations
  - MP-Gadget
  - machine-learning
